84.  Python'da sys moduli nima?
Javob: sys — Python interpretatori bilan ishlash. sys.argv — buyruq qatori argumentlari, sys.path — import yo'llari, sys.exit() — dasturni to'xtatish, sys.stdin/stdout/stderr.
import sys
sys.argv          # ["script.py","arg1","arg2"]
sys.version       # Python versiyasi
sys.exit(0)       # dasturni to'xtatish
85.  Python'da datetime moduli nima?
Javob: datetime — sana va vaqt bilan ishlash. datetime.now() — hozirgi vaqt, timedelta — vaqt farqi, strftime() — formatli chiqish, strptime() — stringdan parse.
from datetime import datetime, timedelta
hozir = datetime.now()
print(hozir.strftime("%Y-%m-%d %H:%M"))
ertaga = hozir + timedelta(days=1)
