130.  Python'da ctypes nima va qanday ishlatiladi?
Javob: ctypes — Python dan C kutubxonalarini (DLL/SO) to'g'ridan-to'g'ri chaqirish. C turlari: c_int, c_double, c_char_p. POINTER, Structure, Union.
import ctypes
libc = ctypes.CDLL("libc.so.6")
